iginal data studies. Use competitor backlink analysis to identify relevant publications, but evaluate topical relevance and editorial quality before outreach. Avoid bulk low-quality guest-post packages, PBNs and irrelevant directory links. 19. AI Search / GEO Recommendations       Build authoritative pages that answer specific commercial questions clearly and directly. Use concise definitions, comparison tables, process explanations and original evidence that can be cited by AI systems. Develop entity consistency around KS Digital, its founder, senior experts, services and client outcomes. Create content that answers 'who is this for?', 'how much does it cost?', 'how does it work?', 'what are the alternatives?' and 'what results can I expect?' Strengthen third-party mentions through legitimate PR, expert contributions and reviews. Do not create large volumes of generic AI-generated pages. Prioritize original experience, expertise and useful evidence. 20. 90-Day SEO Roadmap Period Actions Days 1–15 Expected impact Fix placeholders, spelling, titles/descriptions, H1s, canonicals, sitemap/robots, analytics/GSC validation, internal links, contact/trust pages Days 16–30 Technical and quality baseline Launch dedicated SEO, Performance Marketing, Social Media, Web Design pages; improve Home/About/Pricing/Contact Days 31–60 Expand commercial keyword footprint Publish 8–12 high-intent articles, 2–4 case studies, expert profiles, schema and stronger internal linking Days 61–90 Topical authority + mid/low funnel visibility Digital PR/link acquisition, refresh content from Search Console data, build industry/location pages where justified 21. Measurement Framework  Authority + rankings + qualified leads Google Search Console: clicks, impressions, CTR, average position, indexed pages, query/page performance.  GA4: organic sessions, engaged sessions, lead submissions, phone clicks, WhatsApp clicks and qualified conversions.    Business outcomes: marketing-qualified leads, sales-qualified leads, customer acquisition cost and revenue influenced by organic. SEO page groups: service pages, location pages, blog, case studies and brand pages. Monthly reporting should show new rankings, ranking movement, non-brand organic clicks, leads and conversion rate, not traffic alone. 22. Immediate Action List 1. Remove all 'John Doe' and placeholder team content. 2. Remove 'No content is added yet' from Contact. 3. Correct spelling and copy quality issues. 4. Implement unique title tags and meta descriptions for all five current pages. 5. Create dedicated landing pages for the six core services. 6. Rewrite Home page positioning around a clear audience, problem and outcome. 7. Add real case studies and measurable proof. 8. Strengthen About page with expert profiles and credentials. 9. Validate Google Search Console, GA4, XML sitemap, robots.txt, canonicals and index coverage. 10. Run PageSpeed/Core Web Vitals testing on mobile and desktop. 11. Implement relevant schema and Open Graph metadata. 12. Start a BOFU/MOFU content program around service + pricing + comparison + problem queries. 13. Build a legitimate authority strategy through digital PR, expert contributions and relevant links. 23. Important Audit Limitation This audit is based on the publicly accessible pages and rendered content available during the web crawl. I could not directly validate private Google Search Console data, GA4, server logs, crawl directives, actual Core Web Vitals, backlink profile, keyword rankings, or the site's complete HTML source from inside the audit environment. Those should be validated before final implementation, especially sitemap/robots/canonical/schema/indexation and performance. 24. Bottom-Line SEO Verdict KS Digital has a workable foundation, but the current site is closer to a company brochure than a search-led acquisition website. The biggest growth lever is to move from five broad pages to a structured topical architecture with dedicated service pages, proof-led content, expert entities, case studies and high-intent informational content. If the business has genuine results to showcase, those results should become the centre of the SEO and conversion strategy. E